extends ../layout-marketing

block vars
	- metadata = {title: 'License and credits'}
	- isWebsiteRedesign = true

block content
	main#main-content.content
		.container
			.row
				.col-lg-8.offset-lg-2
					h1 License and credits

					h2.h3 License
					p
						| #{settings.appName} is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify it under the terms of the
						|
						a(href='https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.html') GNU Affero General Public License, version 3
						| , as published by the Free Software Foundation.
					p
						| It is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, express or implied, including the implied warranties of merchantability and fitness for a particular purpose.
					p
						| Everyone who uses #{settings.appName} can get the complete source code of the version running here:
						|
						a(href=settings.sourceCodeUrl) source code
						| .

					h2.h3 Copyright
					ul
						li
							| #{settings.appName} is based on
							|
							a(href='https://github.com/overleaf/overleaf') Overleaf Community Edition
							| , copyright © Overleaf, 2014–2026.
						li
							| Its extended features (login with Google, LDAP and SAML, sandboxed compiles, track changes and comments, the template gallery, the administration tools and more) come from the
							|
							a(href='https://github.com/yu-i-i/overleaf-cep') extended Community Edition
							| , copyright © yu-i-i and davrot, 2024–2026.
						li Changes for IIT Mandi are copyright © 2026 their contributors.
					p
						| Some of this code is adapted from other open-source projects. The source code lists them in
						|
						code CREDITS.md
						|
						| and in the license files of its dependencies.

					h2.h3 Trademarks
					p
						| Overleaf is a trademark of its owner. #{settings.appName} is not affiliated with or endorsed by Overleaf.
